      "side": 1,
      "message": "I figured out why. Because of the bug in `qsort_comp()`, `qsort_comp()` overreads two bytes when `tran_low_t` is defined as `int16_t`. When `qsort_comp()` accesses the last element in `coeff`, it will read two bytes beyond the end of the `coeff` array, which are likely to be uninitialized.",
